{"content_hash": "0c6e0a8a9bc9eb9c", "version_id": 892, "article_id": 90, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "John Lewis launches its 20th Christmas ad, starring a grandma and a toy dog", "title_zh": "John Lewis 发布第 20 支圣诞广告，主角是祖母和玩具狗", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "toodaylab", "source_url": "https://www.toodaylab.com/84280", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1784210156339-43fceaca3548?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8M3x8am9obiUyMGxld2lzfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQwMTMzNjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Catarina Duarte on Unsplash", "author": "Catarina Duarte", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cateduart?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/the-van-gogh-museum-building-with-a-green-lawn-ynFz9p5YcBE?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(299, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(337, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "b52bc96122d4"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-07", "word_count": 147, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "On November 3, UK store John Lewis shared its new Christmas ad. It is called \"Gloria and Pickles\". The message is simple: don't give up on giving.", "lead_zh": "11 月 3 日，英国百货 John Lewis 发布了新的圣诞广告，名字叫《Gloria and Pickles》。它想说的话很简单：别放弃用心送礼。", "preview": "In the ad, a grandmother named Gloria gets ready for her family. She looks for old toys from her childhood, like a pull-along dog called Pic", "preview_zh": "广告里，一位叫 Gloria 的祖母正为家人过节做准备。她想找自己小时候的玩具，比如一只叫 Pickles 的拖拉小狗。但孩子们只想着手机。Gloria 差点就改送钱了。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 875, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/90/en_a2.mp3", "duration": 51.775, "size_bytes": 311616, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/90/en_a2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 52.85, "size_bytes": 318096, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/90/en_a2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/90/en_a2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 56.1, "size_bytes": 337536, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/90/en_a2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/90/en_a2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 48.075, "size_bytes": 289440, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/90/en_a2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/90/en_a2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 52.0, "size_bytes": 312912, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 173, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/90/en_a2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@c9cea96/content/data/versions/892.json", "paragraphs": ["In the ad, a grandmother named Gloria gets ready for her family. She looks for old toys from her childhood, like a pull-along dog called Pickles. But the children only want their phones. Gloria almost gives them money instead.", "Then Pickles tells Gloria not to give up. She builds a fun secret room, and the children love it. Everything she uses comes from John Lewis. The ad ends with the words \"Don't give up on giving\".", "The three-minute film is by Saatchi & Saatchi. Lucy Forbes directed it, and Kristin Scott Thomas plays Gloria. Sam Fender sings a Rolling Stones song in the ad. You can buy the toy dog for £12.99.", "This is John Lewis's 20th Christmas ad. The store started making them in 2007. The ads became famous after \"The Long Wait\" in 2011. John Lewis hopes the ad brings more people into its shops."], "paragraphs_zh": ["广告里，一位叫 Gloria 的祖母正为家人过节做准备。她想找自己小时候的玩具，比如一只叫 Pickles 的拖拉小狗。但孩子们只想着手机。Gloria 差点就改送钱了。", "后来 Pickles 鼓励 Gloria 别放弃。她布置出一间好玩的秘密基地，孩子们特别喜欢。她用的东西全都来自 John Lewis。广告最后打出“别放弃用心送礼”。", "这支 3 分钟的广告由 Saatchi & Saatchi 制作，Lucy Forbes 执导，Kristin Scott Thomas 出演 Gloria。Sam Fender 在片中翻唱了滚石乐队的歌。那只玩具狗售价 12.99 英镑。", "这是 John Lewis 的第 20 支圣诞广告。这家百货从 2007 年开始拍。2011 年的《漫长等待》之后，这些广告才真正走红。John Lewis 希望广告能让更多人走进店里。"], "body": "In the ad, a grandmother named Gloria gets ready for her family. She looks for old toys from her childhood, like a pull-along dog called Pickles. But the children only want their phones. Gloria almost gives them money instead.\n\nThen Pickles tells Gloria not to give up. She builds a fun secret room, and the children love it. Everything she uses comes from John Lewis. The ad ends with the words \"Don't give up on giving\".\n\nThe three-minute film is by Saatchi & Saatchi. Lucy Forbes directed it, and Kristin Scott Thomas plays Gloria. Sam Fender sings a Rolling Stones song in the ad. You can buy the toy dog for £12.99.\n\nThis is John Lewis's 20th Christmas ad. The store started making them in 2007. The ads became famous after \"The Long Wait\" in 2011. John Lewis hopes the ad brings more people into its shops.", "body_zh": "广告里，一位叫 Gloria 的祖母正为家人过节做准备。她想找自己小时候的玩具，比如一只叫 Pickles 的拖拉小狗。但孩子们只想着手机。Gloria 差点就改送钱了。\n\n后来 Pickles 鼓励 Gloria 别放弃。她布置出一间好玩的秘密基地，孩子们特别喜欢。她用的东西全都来自 John Lewis。广告最后打出“别放弃用心送礼”。\n\n这支 3 分钟的广告由 Saatchi & Saatchi 制作，Lucy Forbes 执导，Kristin Scott Thomas 出演 Gloria。Sam Fender 在片中翻唱了滚石乐队的歌。那只玩具狗售价 12.99 英镑。\n\n这是 John Lewis 的第 20 支圣诞广告。这家百货从 2007 年开始拍。2011 年的《漫长等待》之后，这些广告才真正走红。John Lewis 希望广告能让更多人走进店里。", "text": "In the ad, a grandmother named Gloria gets ready for her family. She looks for old toys from her childhood, like a pull-along dog called Pickles. But the children only want their phones. Gloria almost gives them money instead. Then Pickles tells Gloria not to give up. She builds a fun secret room, and the children love it. Everything she uses comes from John Lewis. The ad ends with the words \"Don't give up on giving\". The three-minute film is by Saatchi & Saatchi. Lucy Forbes directed it, and Kristin Scott Thomas plays Gloria. Sam Fender sings a Rolling Stones song in the ad. You can buy the toy dog for £12.99. This is John Lewis's 20th Christmas ad. The store started making them in 2007. The ads became famous after \"The Long Wait\" in 2011. John Lewis hopes the ad brings more people into its shops.", "vocab": [{"word": "launch", "pos": "verb", "zh": "发布；推出", "note": "常指发布广告、产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "ad", "pos": "noun", "zh": "广告", "note": "advertisement 的简称", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "grandmother", "pos": "noun", "zh": "祖母；外婆", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "toy", "pos": "noun", "zh": "玩具", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "give up", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "放弃", "note": "后接名词或动名词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "secret", "pos": "adj", "zh": "秘密的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "direct", "pos": "verb", "zh": "导演", "note": "指拍电影、广告", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "famous", "pos": "adj", "zh": "有名的", "note": "be famous after… 在……之后出名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-07T01:02:45.259729", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "In", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.387, "sm": 300, "em": 387, "cs": 0, "ce": 2, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "the", "s": 0.388, "e": 0.537, "sm": 387, "em": 537, "cs": 3, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "ad", "s": 0.537, "e": 0.85, "sm": 537, "em": 850, "cs": 7, "ce": 9, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": ",", "s": 0.85, "e": 0.9, "sm": 850, "em": 900, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "a", "s": 0.9, "e": 1.0, "sm": 900, "em": 999, "cs": 11, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "g